    "statistical_weight_source_sentence": "For the nondegenerate X1Sigma_g+ electronic state, each vibrational eigenstate has one vibrational state at each v, so g_v=1. Rotational and nuclear-spin statistical factors belong to the rotational partition function and are not included in g_v.",
